### Business Domain Knowledge

#### Fuel Management System
- **Terminals**: Physical devices, initialization, MQTT communication
- **Tanks**: Fuel storage, capacity, calibration, status tracking
- **Deliveries**: Manual and automatic fuel additions, acceptance dates
- **Fuelings**: Automatic and external fuel dispensing
- **FIFO Accounting**: First-In-First-Out inventory tracking per tank per month
- **PW/RW Operations**: Internal receipts and withdrawals

#### User & Access Management
- **Contractors**: Wholesale vs. individual clients
- **Users**: Role-based access (Admin, Warehouseman, Accountant, FleetManager)
- **RFID Cards**: Authentication and authorization at terminals
- **Permissions**: Contractor-based data isolation

#### Reporting & Analytics
- **Standard Reports**: Consumption, Costs, Efficiency, Storage Management
- **Custom Reports**: User-configurable columns and filters
- **Aggregations**: Single-key and multi-key aggregators
- **Metrics**: Fuel amounts, costs, distances, consumption norms
- **Export Formats**: Excel, CSV, PDF generation

#### Alerts & Notifications
- **Alert Types**: Domain event-driven alert creation
- **Subscriptions**: User preference-based alert delivery
- **Payload Structure**: Terminal/Tank identification requirements

